Package: studysim
Type: Package
Title: Study Simulator
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Victor", "Moreno", email = "v.moreno@iconcologia.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Victor Moreno <v.moreno@iconcologia.net>
Description: Simulates plausible medical study datasets for teaching: a clinical
    scenario from an editable library, a study design (cross-sectional, cohort,
    case-control, nested case-control, case-cohort, ecological, randomised,
    cluster, factorial, crossover and longitudinal trials, prognosis, diagnostic
    accuracy), a sample size and some realism (missing data, dropout), with a
    hidden answer key holding the true parameters; several designs can be
    compared on the same population.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, stats, utils, survival, nlme, yaml, jsonlite, digest, openxlsx, zip, tools, ggplot2, grid
Suggests: testthat
